00:15:18,040 --> 00:15:21,290
Why don't we get rid of the tape and pretend it never existed.

264
00:15:21,750 --> 00:15:23,670
I could do that.

265
00:15:21,750 --> 00:15:23,670
Okay.

266
00:15:28,340 --> 00:15:31,050
Okay, now all we gotta do is get rid of this chair.

267
00:15:33,510 --> 00:15:35,220
Come here.

268
00:15:47,070 --> 00:15:48,820
Oh, thank God!

269
00:15:47,070 --> 00:15:48,820
I know.

270
00:15:49,440 --> 00:15:50,940
Come in!

271
00:15:51,110 --> 00:15:54,240
Hi. I'm sorry to barge in on your Valentine.

272
00:15:54,410 --> 00:15:58,200
I had to get away from the yelling. Mona is dumping Ross.

273
00:15:58,410 --> 00:16:00,750
Oh, my God.

274
00:15:58,410 --> 00:16:00,750
Poor Ross.

275
00:16:04,380 --> 00:16:07,090
Oh, great. We have to watch him do yoga in his underwear...

276
00:16:07,250 --> 00:16:09,380
...but for this he closes the drapes.

277
00:16:10,800 --> 00:16:13,220
Rach, you know that birthing tape you wanted to see?

278
00:16:13,380 --> 00:16:15,300
It's here.

279
00:16:15,470 --> 00:16:19,600
Oh, and we should warn you before you watch it. Don't watch it.

280
00:16:20,520 --> 00:16:22,310
Why, you saw it? Is it scary?

281
00:16:22,520 --> 00:16:26,230
Let's just say it's ironic how footage of someone being born...

282
00:16:26,400 --> 00:16:29,320
...can make you want to kill yourself.

283
00:16:30,070 --> 00:16:34,070
Now, wait, now I'm all freaked out. You guys will watch it with me?

284
00:16:34,280 --> 00:16:38,910
No, but I will leave a sweater that smells like me right next to you.

285
00:16:39,790 --> 00:16:43,370
Come on, seriously, you're not gonna make me watch this alone.

286
00:16:46,630 --> 00:16:49,210
She's right. Of course not.

287
00:16:49,420 --> 00:16:51,590
Honey, get the tape.

288
00:16:58,640 --> 00:17:02,640
This reminds me of a very specific part of the tape.

289
00:17:05,350 --> 00:17:08,020
Okay. Here we go.

290
00:17:08,230 --> 00:17:09,940
Okay. Ahem.

291
00:17:12,070 --> 00:17:13,740
Oh, my.

292
00:17:15,150 --> 00:17:17,410
All right, baby. One more time.

293
00:17:17,610 --> 00:17:20,950
Why is that baby torturing that woman?

294
00:17:21,160 --> 00:17:24,660
Why have I seen this thing three times?

295
00:17:26,670 --> 00:17:27,870
It's still beautiful.

296
00:17:28,080 --> 00:17:31,380
Aah! It's horrible!

297
00:17:28,080 --> 00:17:31,380
I know, I know!

298
00:17:31,550 --> 00:17:33,710
I'm so sorry for you!

299
00:17:31,550 --> 00:17:33,710
Oh, my God!

300
00:17:34,510 --> 00:17:38,680
You guys! You guys, look!

301
00:17:34,510 --> 00:17:38,680
What? Did her ass explode?

302
00:17:41,180 --> 00:17:44,310
No, the baby's out. Look. Look.

303
00:17:45,980 --> 00:17:50,150
Look at those little fingers and toes.

304
00:17:50,360 --> 00:17:52,480
And look how happy the mom is now.

305
00:17:53,690 --> 00:17:58,070
Oh, Rach.

306
00:17:53,690 --> 00:17:58,070
Screw you! You don't have to do it!

307
00:18:02,200 --> 00:18:03,990
Hey.

308
00:18:02,200 --> 00:18:03,990
Hey! What...

309
00:18:04,240 --> 00:18:07,790
What's up?

310
00:18:04,240 --> 00:18:07,790
Uh, Mona just dumped me.

311
00:18:08,000 --> 00:18:10,790
Oh, man, I'm sorry. Why?

312
00:18:11,000 --> 00:18:15,510
With everything going on lately, I haven't exactly been the perfect boyfriend.

313
00:18:15,670 --> 00:18:18,340
I didn't tell her I got Rachel pregnant.

314
00:18:18,590 --> 00:18:23,680
I gave her a key to my apartment and then had the locks changed.

315
00:18:23,930 --> 00:18:27,430
Then I lied to her about Rachel moving in with me.

316
00:18:27,680 --> 00:18:32,610
In a way, I judge her for not breaking up with me sooner.

317
00:18:32,820 --> 00:18:35,780
That really sucks. Especially on Valentine's Day.

318
00:18:35,940 --> 00:18:40,530
Yeah. Wait a minute. What are you doing here?

319
00:18:40,740 --> 00:18:43,620
Joey Tribbiani without a date on Valentine's Day?

320
00:18:43,870 --> 00:18:47,160
What's going on, huh? Girl trouble? Heh.

321
00:18:48,620 --> 00:18:50,960
Sort of. Ha, ha.

322
00:18:48,620 --> 00:18:50,960
Really?

323
00:18:51,210 --> 00:18:53,670
You don't have to seem so happy about it.

324
00:18:53,840 --> 00:18:58,460
Sorry. Well, uh, maybe I can help.

325
00:18:53,840 --> 00:18:58,460
Oh, I...

326
00:18:58,670 --> 00:19:02,050
Whatever it is, I am sure it has happened to me.

327
00:19:03,180 --> 00:19:07,140
You know, actually, once I got dumped during sex.

328
00:19:12,190 --> 00:19:16,230
So anyway, uh, what is it?

329
00:19:12,190 --> 00:19:16,230
Forget about it. It's no big deal.

330
00:19:16,480 --> 00:19:18,940
Come on, what is it?

331
00:19:16,480 --> 00:19:18,940
It's nothing.

332
00:19:19,190 --> 00:19:21,950
Hey, it's me. Why can't you tell me?

333
00:19:24,450 --> 00:19:28,080
Okay. Uh, sit down. Um...

334
00:19:31,920 --> 00:19:35,710
There's this woman that I like a lot.

335
00:19:35,880 --> 00:19:38,090
But, uh, it can't happen.

336
00:19:39,260 --> 00:19:40,840
She's not a Tribbiani?

337
00:19:43,550 --> 00:19:44,680
No!

338
00:19:46,140 --> 00:19:49,100
So, uh... So is she someone from work?

339
00:19:50,640 --> 00:19:51,680
Yes.

340
00:19:52,390 --> 00:19:54,270
Well, um, does she like you?

341
00:19:56,270 --> 00:19:58,570
Sometimes I think maybe she could.

342
00:19:58,820 --> 00:20:01,400
But it doesn't matter, I can't do anything about it.

343
00:20:01,610 --> 00:20:02,740
Why not?

344
00:20:02,990 --> 00:20:04,740
It's complicated.

345
00:20:06,280 --> 00:20:08,830
She was with this other guy. For a long time.

346
00:20:09,080 --> 00:20:10,830
Someone from work too.

347
00:20:11,000 --> 00:20:12,660
And, uh...

348
00:20:12,830 --> 00:20:16,330
I could never do that to the guy. We're friends.

349
00:20:17,210 --> 00:20:22,420
So, uh, this guy she used to go out with, is he still in love with her?

350
00:20:22,630 --> 00:20:25,510
No, I don't think so.

351
00:20:22,630 --> 00:20:25,510
Okay.

352
00:20:25,760 --> 00:20:27,510
Is he a good guy?

353
00:20:29,180 --> 00:20:31,100
Yeah, he's the best.

354
00:20:31,310 --> 00:20:34,020
Then talk to him. He might be fine.

355
00:20:31,310 --> 00:20:34,020
I don't know.

356
00:20:34,230 --> 00:20:37,440
It's worth finding out, if you really like her.

357
00:20:37,650 --> 00:20:39,270
I do, so much.

358
00:20:39,520 --> 00:20:42,360
I can't stop thinking about her. I can't sleep...

359
00:20:42,610 --> 00:20:46,030
Okay, Joey, you know what? You have to go for it.

360
00:20:46,280 --> 00:20:51,410
How often does this happen to you? You owe it to yourself.

361
00:20:52,040 --> 00:20:54,080
Here's your warm milk.

362
00:20:58,630 --> 00:21:01,750
I'm gonna put the bourbon in it at home.

363
00:21:03,720 --> 00:21:08,680
Anyway, seriously, just talk to the guy, okay?

364
00:21:08,850 --> 00:21:11,310
Let me know how it goes.

365
00:21:12,720 --> 00:21:14,640
It's Rachel.

366
00:21:24,570 --> 00:21:27,860
You're gonna have a baby and you need to be prepared.

367
00:21:28,030 --> 00:21:32,830
You're gonna make yourself watch the whole thing. Just do it!

368
00:21:35,660 --> 00:21:39,040
Heh, I came to the big city to become a star.

369
00:21:40,250 --> 00:21:43,920
I'll do anything to make that happen.

370
00:21:40,250 --> 00:21:43,920
Anything?

371
00:21:44,090 --> 00:21:48,680
Hmm. Maybe it starts with how she gets pregnant.

